---
title: AI Work Estimation and Pricing Assistant -- MVP.M1 + EAP.M1.UI1 (Current State)
---
flowchart TD
    User["Nontechnical business user"]

    subgraph UI["UI layer -- app.py (Streamlit, single-page wizard + persistent sidebar)"]
        Wizard["5-step wizard\n(work type, quick facts, scope checklist,\ncomplexity and AI, review and estimate)"]
        Sidebar["Persistent sidebar\n(step status, current estimate,\nrunning estimate, warnings)"]
    end

    subgraph Helpers["Non-authoritative UI-support helpers -- src/"]
        ScopeDefaults["scope_defaults.py\nscope defaults + confirmation %"]
        AssumptionEngine["assumption_engine.py\ntemplate-based assumptions"]
        RunningPreview["running_estimate_preview.py\n\"Preliminary\" partial-complexity view"]
    end

    subgraph Models["src/models.py"]
        EstimateRequest["EstimateRequest\n(assembled at Review step)"]
    end

    subgraph Engines["Authoritative engine layer -- src/ (unchanged since MVP.M1)"]
        ComplexityEngine["complexity_engine.py\nweighted score + contributions"]
        SizingEngine["sizing_engine.py\nRJS / T-shirt / sprint range"]
        ContractFit["contract_fit.py\ncontract-fit status"]
    end

    subgraph Config["Configuration -- data/ (governed JSON)"]
        Weights["complexity_weights.json"]
        Questions["complexity_questions.json"]
        Bands["sizing_bands.json"]
        Terms["contract_terms.json"]
        ScopeConfig["scope_checklist_items.json"]
        AssumptionConfig["assumption_templates.json"]
    end

    HumanReview["Human review point\n(Review step -- Step 5,\nrequired before calculation runs)"]

    subgraph PricingPreview["Future pricing interaction preview -- illustrative only, not authoritative"]
        RatePreview["RoleRatePreviewRow / RoleRatePreviewSet\nhardcoded example data, never wired\nto EstimateRequest or any calculation"]
    end

    subgraph FutureScope["Not implemented -- deferred"]
        FuturePlanning["Governed phase/resource planning,\npricing, support, SOW\n(MVP.M2-M6)"]
        AIAdapter["Estimator's own AI-assisted intake\n(MVP.M7, replaceable interface)"]
    end

    User -->|answers wizard steps 1-4| Wizard
    Wizard <-->|reads defaults, writes corrections| ScopeDefaults
    ScopeDefaults -->|reads| ScopeConfig
    Wizard -->|answered-so-far scores| RunningPreview
    RunningPreview -->|reuses, does not modify| SizingEngine
    RunningPreview -->|"Preliminary" size/duration| Sidebar
    ScopeDefaults -->|scope-confirmation %| Sidebar

    Wizard -->|confirms inputs| HumanReview
    HumanReview -->|selections + unknown items| AssumptionEngine
    AssumptionEngine -->|reads| AssumptionConfig
    AssumptionEngine -->|editable assumptions| Wizard
    HumanReview -->|assembles| EstimateRequest
    EstimateRequest --> ComplexityEngine
    ComplexityEngine -->|reads| Weights
    ComplexityEngine -->|reads| Questions
    ComplexityEngine -->|unrounded score| SizingEngine
    SizingEngine -->|reads| Bands
    SizingEngine -->|max sprint estimate| ContractFit
    ContractFit -->|reads| Terms
    ContractFit -->|governed results| Sidebar
    ContractFit -->|governed results| Wizard
    Wizard -->|displays| User

    Wizard -.->|separate, clearly labeled section| RatePreview

    Wizard -.->|not built yet| FuturePlanning
    Wizard -.->|not built yet| AIAdapter

    classDef future stroke-dasharray: 5 5,opacity:0.6;
    class FuturePlanning,AIAdapter,RatePreview future;
